Z||000003||GT-maniac||07-07-2000||01:00 AM||||Just thought I'd say this has got to be the easiest upgrade I've done on the fiero.<BR>I bought my poly bushings from the fiero store for 25 bucks. Really simple to do, took off the old dog bone, knocked out the worn out rubber bushings and popped the new ones in. Then just put the dogbone back in, used one hand to pull the engine back and the other to push in the bolt. Easy ! 10 minute job tops !||||reg||1
